add('tf-refusal-box-render-state-fade-and-depth-submission',[whole('entity/ProtectionBox.java'),whole('client/renderer/entity/ProtectionBoxRenderer.java'),whole('client/model/entity/ProtectionBoxModel.java'),whole('client/renderer/TFRenderTypes.java'),whole('client/renderer/TFRenderPipelines.java'),(p+'client/event/ClientRegistrationEvents.java',115,153),(p+'client/event/ClientRegistrationEvents.java',241,363)],'已注册ProtectionBoxRenderer→抽取本ticklife及尺寸→submitModel末20tick alpha=life/20→按bbox尺寸*16+2扩张cube，尺寸变化才重建→PROTECTION_BOX类型贴图滚动、上传排序→专用pipeline TRANSLUCENT/noCull/ALPHA_CUTOUT0.1/EMISSIVE/DepthStencilState.DEFAULT。','是真实游戏拒绝反馈专用提交，通用图形API/模型包装不另计。shouldRender直接true，未用Frustum；life未减partialTick，低帧率观感需实机。使用DEFAULT深度而非显式ALWAYS_PASS，未读取运行时依赖DEFAULT具体定义，不能声称穿墙或绝对正确深度；没有制作/借用其资产。','灰字/微光应明确渲染层、深度与寿命，透明/发光/几何非空不能证明实际可辨；身体模型由专业对话做，不由文字逻辑岗替代。')
